In my experience, mind flayers aren't _too_ nasty if:

   1) You have the intrinsics teleport and teleport control;

   2) You're wearing a helmet; and

   3) You are carrying a blessed unicorn horn.

When the mf gets you, teleport away, restore yourself with the unicorn
horn, then go back after the mind flayer. It worked for Elvis the
ascended Samurai, and it'll work for you, too.

Or, you can genocide them. Eventually, that worked for Elvis, who found
that the thrill had worn off.
